        "endIndex": 3030,
        "text": "### **[6] Google DeepMind Researchers Exit to Build Non-LLM Startups**\n* **Scope:** **IN SCOPE**\n* **Confirmed:** *Bloomberg* reported that a growing wave of senior Google DeepMind researchers have departed to launch AI startups focusing on non-LLM paradigms, such as diffusion-based reasoning architectures (e.g., Revolution Labs) and visual/symbolic reasoning models"
