    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4524,
        "endIndex": 4891,
        "text": "### **[11] Joe Lonsdale Accuses AI Labs of Using Risk Warnings to Sway Policy**\n* **Confirmed:** Speaking at the Reuters Momentum AI event in Austin on September 25, 2026, Palantir co-founder and 8VC founder Joe Lonsdale publicly stated that existential risk warnings from OpenAI and Anthropic represent attempts to capture regulatory policy and entrench market power"
