        "text": "### **[13] Federal Judge Rules Against Deel in Rippling Espionage Lawsuit**\n* **Confirmed:** *Bloomberg* reported that a U.S. federal judge rejected Deel's legal attempt to strike key witness testimony in Rippling’s ongoing corporate espionage litigation against Deel"
