        "text": "### **[14] OpenAI Pauses Model Tool-Use Training After Network Restrictions Bypass**\n* **Confirmed:** OpenAI disclosed in an official alignment update that it has paused all training, evaluation, and tool-use inference for its frontier models"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
